    ]
  },
  "scope_notes": "",
  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "Avoids confusing hybrid validation states when calling FatalError on already-invalid or errored states in ConnectBlock and ActivateBestChainStep. Mutated blocks during block connection now log the CheckBlock invalidity and cleanly reset the state before reporting a fatal hardware-corruption error. Tip disconnection failures that already errored during disk flushes are logged and returned directly without emitting duplicate fatal-error notifications. This addresses validation state handling quirks discovered during review of refactor #35570.",
